# @dcl-sdk/utils Context7 Reference

> **Important (2026-01-21+)**: Most functionality shown below is now **redundant with native SDK7 helpers**.
>
> **Do not add `@dcl-sdk/utils` by default.** Prefer the native APIs in `@dcl/sdk/ecs`, `@dcl/sdk/math`, and the global timer functions.
>
> Keep `@dcl-sdk/utils` only for **non-native convenience helpers** (for example: quick debug primitives like `addTestCube()` / `addLabel()`, or higher-level utilities that SDK7 still doesn’t expose natively).

## Installation & Import
<!--
